@startuml
title Paper Registration Activity Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

|Author or Coordinator|
start
:Open Paper Registration Form;
:Input Title & Abstract (Mandatory);
:Select Paper Topics;

fork
  :Upload Manuscript (PDF);
fork again
  :Provide Overleaf Link;
fork again
  :Provide Other Links;
end fork

|System|
:Save Paper as Draft;
:Register Paper in System;

|Author|
:Optionally Update Abstract/Topics anytime;
note right: No notifications sent\non topic/abstract updates

|Coordinator|
:Review Registered Paper;
:Search for potential Parent Papers;
if (Parent Paper Exists?) then (Yes)
  :Link Parent Paper(s);
else (No)
endif

stop
@enduml
